1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 27]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:02:01,790 --> 00:02:02,290
Laogou,

4
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,180
here.

5
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:07,820
Wait...

6
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:08,220
Here.

7
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:09,820
Make do with this.

8
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:12,130
Here.

9
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:14,890
Sit down.

10
00:02:15,710 --> 00:02:16,850
You're hurt. Where are you going?

11
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,100
Eat the flatbread.

12
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,380
Well, I...

13
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,500
Laogou,

14
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,290
isn't it a little awkward for me to sit here?

15
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,130
What's awkward about it?

16
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:27,690
By the way,

17
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:29,540
how did you get hurt?

18
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:31,100
How come Master Zhang

19
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:31,940
didn't get a scratch?

20
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,380
Come on.

21
00:02:33,150 --> 00:02:35,260
Master Zhang has Qiongqi protecting him.

22
00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:37,690
I'm just flesh and blood,

23
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,730
and I can barely fight back.

24
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,260
Someone slashed me right here...

25
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,290
He's back.

26
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,010
Master Zhang,

27
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:49,220
the medical staff

28
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,100
detained by the Japanese

29
00:02:50,190 --> 00:02:50,980
have all been rescued.

30
00:02:51,590 --> 00:02:52,380
They and Unit 401

31
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:53,780
have been sent to the hospital.

32
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:55,820
Good.

33
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:59,010
Compile everything about the Xumi Realm

34
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,100
and the Japanese military's plan

35
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,340
as soon as possible

36
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:03,660
and report it to the higher-ups.

37
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:04,850
Yes, sir.

38
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:08,260
Stinky Yu.

39
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:09,130
Stinky Yu, come here.

40
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:10,010
Give me a hand.

41
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:12,820
I'm heading back.

42
00:03:13,910 --> 00:03:14,730
Come on. Let's go.

43
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,170
At long last,

44
00:03:49,430 --> 00:03:50,500
this whole mess

45
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:51,940
is over.

46
00:03:54,150 --> 00:03:54,940
Anyway,

47
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:56,780
I did find

48
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:58,780
your men for you.

49
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:00,730
Thank you.

50
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,820
In that case,

51
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:06,130
I'll keep my promise

52
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,410
and leave the Mystic Nine.

53
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,450
We're brothers.

54
00:04:13,030 --> 00:04:14,570
What I said back then was only a joke.

55
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,220
Why take it seriously?

56
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,140
The misunderstanding between us

57
00:04:21,630 --> 00:04:22,610
is cleared up now.

58
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:24,810
You don't have to leave

59
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:26,580
the Mystic Nine.

60
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:28,810
A joke?

61
00:04:30,430 --> 00:04:32,460
You forced Tiezui to swear

62
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,370
a deadly oath

63
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:35,290
on his own family line.

64
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,050
If Tiezui really ends up

65
00:04:37,070 --> 00:04:38,250
with no descendants,

66
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:41,370
you might be cut to pieces.

67
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,930
Back then...

68
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,050
Back then, I only said what would happen

69
00:04:50,070 --> 00:04:51,170
if you and Tiezui

70
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:52,410
broke your oath, not me.

71
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,250
Now I'm the one breaking my word.

72
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,340
Whatever the consequences,

73
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:56,900
I'll bear them.

74
00:04:58,190 --> 00:04:59,370
Then the head of the Mystic Nine...

75
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,050
It has to be you, of course.

76
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,100
Who else could it be?

77
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,100
After everything we've been through,

78
00:05:13,070 --> 00:05:14,700
with the Ministry of War, the Mystic Nine,

79
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,900
and the Japanese,

80
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:18,490
I understand now.

81
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,050
Your burden is heavier than any of ours.

82
00:05:22,070 --> 00:05:23,100
Protecting the Mystic Nine is hard.

83
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,220
Protecting Changsha

84
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:26,810
is even harder.

85
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,220
But, Master Zhang,

86
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,370
you did it.

87
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,540
I didn't do it alone.

88
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,850
We did it together.

89
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,250
No matter what storms come our way,

90
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:43,250
the Mystic Nine will stand united

91
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,660
as long as the Xiang River flows.

92
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:47,290
Yes.

93
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:03,620
[Changsha Garrison Command]

94
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:14,010
Officer Luo,

95
00:06:14,590 --> 00:06:16,340
I'm honored that you called me personally.

96
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:17,820
Wenhai,

97
00:06:18,990 --> 00:06:20,850
I hear you've been doing quite well

98
00:06:20,870 --> 00:06:21,730
in Changsha.

99
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:23,850
The higher-ups think highly of you.

100
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:26,660
What are you working on lately?

101
00:06:27,550 --> 00:06:28,250
You're too kind, sir.

102
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:30,010
I'm only following orders.

103
00:06:30,450 --> 00:06:32,250
I've been ordered to purge

104
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:34,410
the Mystic Nine from Changsha.

105
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,380
The Mystic Nine have long been entrenched here,

106
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,250
with ties running deep.

107
00:06:37,550 --> 00:06:38,730
I'm trying to devise a sound plan

108
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,450
that will keep Changsha stable

109
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:41,730
while also completing the task

110
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:42,940
from our superiors as soon as possible.

111
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:45,820
Sir,

112
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:49,450
may I ask for your guidance?

113
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:51,970
With your wisdom and experience,

114
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:53,450
perhaps you can help me

115
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,220
clear up my doubts.

116
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:58,850
In my courtyard,

117
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,220
there's a Buddhist pine

118
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:02,380
with deep roots and lush foliage.

119
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,850
Pruning a tree is an art.

120
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:08,130
Cut too much, and you damage the roots.

121
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,900
Cut too little, and pests take hold.

122
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:14,940
But if you try to uproot it,

123
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:15,940
you'll find

124
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,620
its roots have long become entwined

125
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,530
with the house and walls.

126
00:07:19,030 --> 00:07:20,100
If you truly pull it out,

127
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:21,850
the whole house

128
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:24,290
could come down with it.

129
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,290
I understand.

130
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,500
So,

131
00:07:32,150 --> 00:07:33,130
pruning a tree

132
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,820
doesn't always mean uprooting it.

133
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,250
I'll remember that.

134
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:39,620
Thank you for your guidance, sir.

135
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,290
Come in.

136
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:53,940
Sir,

137
00:07:54,150 --> 00:07:54,940
do we move now?

138
00:07:56,710 --> 00:07:58,530
The arrow is already on the string.

139
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,660
But no one is to be killed.

140
00:08:02,470 --> 00:08:03,290
Find a few charges

141
00:08:03,310 --> 00:08:04,130
and lock them up.

142
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:47,010
I've long heard of the Xiangxi assassins.

143
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:48,330
They say you

144
00:08:48,350 --> 00:08:49,820
specialize in solving difficult problems.

145
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:51,940
I happen to have one

146
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,860
I'd like your help with.

147
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,890
I want the heads of the Mystic Nine's clan leaders.

148
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:04,940
This is the deposit.

149
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:06,620
Once it's done,

150
00:09:07,030 --> 00:09:07,940
I'll pay you ten times as much.

151
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,940
In three days,

152
00:09:10,710 --> 00:09:11,650
you'll have their heads.

153
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,940
Can you really

154
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,180
kill the Mystic Nine?

155
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:18,300
We come from the same clan as Zhang Qishan.

156
00:09:18,670 --> 00:09:19,690
We can do

157
00:09:21,110 --> 00:09:22,500
whatever he can.

158
00:09:25,150 --> 00:09:27,090
Why come to us only now?

159
00:09:27,670 --> 00:09:29,300
My superiors had other plans before.

160
00:09:30,590 --> 00:09:32,690
Now I'm fully in charge.

161
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:33,980
If you change your mind,

162
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:37,590
[Heixiao, leader of the Xiangxi assassins]

163
00:09:37,590 --> 00:09:38,770
the deposit is nonrefundable.

164
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:43,860
Eryue Hong has a secret chamber.

165
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:46,450
Very few people in this world know

166
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:47,860
how to get inside.

167
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,570
And I've heard

168
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,180
even explosives

169
00:09:51,270 --> 00:09:52,500
can't breach it.

170
00:09:53,710 --> 00:09:55,330
Since the city was sealed, he's been hiding there

171
00:09:55,590 --> 00:09:56,690
and hasn't shown himself once.

172
00:09:56,960 --> 00:10:09,740
♪The moon-worship hall stands empty as clouds mass across the night sky♪

173
00:10:11,470 --> 00:10:12,690
Eryue Hong's weakness

174
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,090
is his late wife.

175
00:10:15,110 --> 00:10:16,300
Make good use of that.

176
00:10:17,230 --> 00:10:18,010
Though Chen Pi

177
00:10:18,030 --> 00:10:19,010
is Eryue Hong's disciple,

178
00:10:19,790 --> 00:10:21,210
he resents Eryue Hong

179
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:23,060
because he believes Eryue Hong

180
00:10:23,270 --> 00:10:24,300
caused the death of the woman

181
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:26,250
he cared about most, Eryue Hong's wife.

182
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,380
I've heard Chen Pi

183
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,090
has entered

184
00:10:29,110 --> 00:10:30,940
Eryue Hong's secret chamber many times to kill him.

185
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,250
So Chen Pi must know

186
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:35,060
how to get inside.

187
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:59,090
Not nearly as good as what Madam made.

188
00:11:21,470 --> 00:11:23,130
My memory isn't very good.

189
00:11:23,470 --> 00:11:24,890
I've stepped on countless ants,

190
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,420
but why don't I remember

191
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:32,090
ever killing anyone in Xiangxi?

192
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,090
Today,

193
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,250
I'll give you something to remember.

194
00:12:11,880 --> 00:12:13,210
Do you recognize

195
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:17,250
your master's wife's coffin?

196
00:12:20,790 --> 00:12:21,690
As long as you...

197
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:22,940
You have a death wish!

198
00:13:05,390 --> 00:13:05,900
Madam.

199
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,730
Madam...

200
00:13:37,870 --> 00:13:38,370
Is he dead?

201
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:41,450
He was hit by a Xiangxi poison needle.

202
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:43,570
If you want him dead,

203
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,260
throw him into filthy water,

204
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:46,570
and he'll rot away at once.

205
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:48,900
If you want him alive,

206
00:13:50,470 --> 00:13:51,450
here's the antidote.

207
00:13:52,510 --> 00:13:53,540
You decide.

208
00:13:54,710 --> 00:13:55,780
I need him alive

209
00:13:56,110 --> 00:13:57,060
to find Eryue Hong.

210
00:14:23,750 --> 00:14:24,940
Anyone who dares move against the Mystic Nine

211
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:26,300
must have someone powerful behind them.

212
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:28,610
Does the recent lockdown of Changsha

213
00:14:29,350 --> 00:14:30,940
have anything to do with this?

214
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,020
Is the Ministry of War behind it?

215
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:37,450
No need to probe.

216
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:40,820
Officer Luo knows how formidable the Zhang Clan is

217
00:14:41,510 --> 00:14:43,090
and has been searching everywhere for its members.

218
00:14:43,990 --> 00:14:45,420
We're traitors to the Zhang Clan,

219
00:14:45,870 --> 00:14:47,330
and our faces bear the mark.

220
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:55,570
Who you are doesn't matter.

221
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,090
Because I won't let you

222
00:14:58,110 --> 00:14:58,900
leave here alive!

223
00:15:14,510 --> 00:15:16,210
You hurt my master's wife.

224
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,420
Every one of you will die!

225
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:35,660
Eryue Hong!

226
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:38,060
Why did you disable the mechanism?

227
00:15:40,470 --> 00:15:41,540
I don't need you to save me.

228
00:15:43,710 --> 00:15:44,780
Isn't it a little late

229
00:15:44,990 --> 00:15:46,180
to pretend you care now?

230
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,090
Eryue Hong!

231
00:16:01,870 --> 00:16:02,570
Eryue Hong!

232
00:16:16,110 --> 00:16:17,060
Chen Pi,

233
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:18,730
you did well.

234
00:16:58,630 --> 00:16:59,180
Yatou,

235
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:02,690
I'm sorry you had to suffer.

236
00:17:36,710 --> 00:17:38,540
Xie Jiu is the brains of the Mystic Nine.

237
00:17:39,230 --> 00:17:40,900
Ever since he returned from Beiping,

238
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,370
his health has kept deteriorating.

239
00:17:42,710 --> 00:17:44,610
Now he relies on morphine just to stay alive.

240
00:17:44,870 --> 00:17:46,210
He's already finished.

241
00:17:47,510 --> 00:17:48,090
Ninth Master!

242
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:49,020
Quick!

243
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:50,330
Quick!

244
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:51,140
Get him inside!

245
00:17:51,140 --> 00:17:55,500
[Resuscitation Room]

246
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:17,280
[Good and Evil]

247
00:18:17,280 --> 00:18:18,450
As for Banjie Li,

248
00:18:19,590 --> 00:18:21,020
though he's only half a man now...

249
00:18:21,110 --> 00:18:21,610
San'er.

250
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:24,020
His eyes and ears are all over Changsha.

251
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:25,780
But he has a weakness too:

252
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:28,090
his sister-in-law and son.

253
00:18:28,390 --> 00:18:29,090
Third Master!

254
00:18:29,750 --> 00:18:30,260
Chunhua!

255
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:31,370
Don't move.

256
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:35,260
If you don't want her ending up like you,

257
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:36,610
put your blade away.

258
00:18:49,350 --> 00:18:49,850
Tell me.

259
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,140
What do you want?

260
00:18:54,590 --> 00:18:55,330
Kneel.

261
00:18:57,390 --> 00:18:58,330
Crawl over here.

262
00:19:13,630 --> 00:19:14,210
Third Master!

263
00:19:16,230 --> 00:19:17,090
Don't do anything foolish.

264
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,060
It took you so much

265
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,300
to get where you are today.

266
00:19:20,870 --> 00:19:22,140
Don't you understand that?

267
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:24,820
Let them kill me.

268
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,370
Once I'm dead,

269
00:19:26,990 --> 00:19:28,210
they can't threaten you anymore.

270
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:43,140
Third Master!

271
00:19:54,990 --> 00:19:55,690
Heibei

272
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:57,610
is the strongest fighter in the Mystic Nine.

273
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,490
Capturing him alive

274
00:19:59,510 --> 00:20:00,820
would normally take some effort.

275
00:20:01,320 --> 00:20:03,420
But now he has a weakness too.

276
00:20:03,750 --> 00:20:04,370
Heibei,

277
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:05,690
leave me.

278
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:06,610
Go.

279
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:07,490
Go!

280
00:20:27,390 --> 00:20:28,210
Your life

281
00:20:28,870 --> 00:20:29,900
belongs to me.

282
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:33,660
Let's go.

283
00:20:34,470 --> 00:20:35,370
Let's leave Changsha

284
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:37,330
and leave all this trouble behind.

285
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:06,540
Look out!

286
00:21:33,150 --> 00:21:34,740
You were hit by our Xiangxi poison needle,

287
00:21:34,910 --> 00:21:36,260
and you're still holding on?

288
00:21:36,870 --> 00:21:38,540
You killed so many of my men.

289
00:21:39,590 --> 00:21:41,650
Your woman can die with them!

290
00:21:41,800 --> 00:21:42,820
Don't you dare!

291
00:21:43,390 --> 00:21:44,020
Heibei,

292
00:21:44,840 --> 00:21:45,850
do you remember

293
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,260
when I used to comb your hair?

294
00:21:49,040 --> 00:21:49,890
You said

295
00:21:51,430 --> 00:21:52,850
my bones were the hardest

296
00:21:54,190 --> 00:21:56,820
and perfect for a dagger handle.

297
00:22:20,080 --> 00:22:20,740
Heibei.

298
00:22:21,280 --> 00:22:22,500
Have you lost your mind?

299
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:24,570
Didn't you say

300
00:22:25,560 --> 00:22:27,460
you only respected women who weren't afraid to die?

301
00:22:32,910 --> 00:22:33,410
Heibei!

302
00:22:33,760 --> 00:22:36,090
Let go!

303
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,460
Let go!

304
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:41,570
Heibei.

305
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:42,820
Heibei!

306
00:22:43,760 --> 00:22:44,780
Heibei!

307
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:08,170
This Xiangxi poison really is potent.

308
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:17,780
Huo Wenhai,

309
00:23:18,870 --> 00:23:19,370
what...

310
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:20,980
what do you want?

311
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:24,850
You've got some nerve.

312
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:27,500
How dare you call me by my name?

313
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:33,610
I'm here to save you.

314
00:23:34,670 --> 00:23:35,780
The Mystic Nine are finished.

315
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:37,930
I'm a member of the Huo Clan after all.

316
00:23:38,110 --> 00:23:39,410
I can't just stand by

317
00:23:39,430 --> 00:23:40,890
and watch my clan get dragged down by the scum

318
00:23:40,910 --> 00:23:41,610
from the other clans.

319
00:23:42,040 --> 00:23:42,780
From today on,

320
00:23:42,800 --> 00:23:43,980
I'm in charge of the Huo Clan.

321
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:46,300
You're no longer part of the Mystic Nine either.

322
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:47,890
Is that clear?

323
00:23:51,080 --> 00:23:51,850
What a pity.

324
00:23:52,520 --> 00:23:53,500
Xiangu isn't here today.

325
00:23:54,520 --> 00:23:55,500
I'll give you some time

326
00:23:57,280 --> 00:23:58,540
to think carefully

327
00:23:59,670 --> 00:24:00,740
about who you'll be loyal to

328
00:24:01,520 --> 00:24:02,570
from now on.

329
00:24:22,540 --> 00:24:25,420
[Chaozong Gate]

330
00:24:26,280 --> 00:24:27,220
What's going on?

331
00:24:29,080 --> 00:24:29,890
Are we going to war?

332
00:24:31,280 --> 00:24:31,740
Master Zhang,

333
00:24:32,630 --> 00:24:33,330
those on the tower

334
00:24:33,350 --> 00:24:34,130
don't look like our men.

335
00:24:34,430 --> 00:24:35,300
I'll go find out.

336
00:24:35,670 --> 00:24:36,220
Master Zhang.

337
00:24:36,950 --> 00:24:37,460
Master Zhang!

338
00:24:48,080 --> 00:24:48,540
Master Zhang,

339
00:24:48,870 --> 00:24:49,820
you're finally back.

340
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:50,740
Xiaojin?

341
00:24:51,520 --> 00:24:52,370
What happened?

342
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:54,460
Has the city been sealed?

343
00:24:55,280 --> 00:24:55,740
Yes.

344
00:24:56,670 --> 00:24:57,370
Orders came from above

345
00:24:57,840 --> 00:24:59,460
to eradicate a cult.

346
00:24:59,870 --> 00:25:00,610
A cult?

347
00:25:01,630 --> 00:25:02,980
What cult is there in Changsha?

348
00:25:11,280 --> 00:25:11,930
Officer Xiaojin.

349
00:25:13,520 --> 00:25:14,130
I looked into it.

350
00:25:14,800 --> 00:25:15,570
The Honghua Sect

351
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:16,780
is a cult that appeared

352
00:25:16,800 --> 00:25:17,890
along the Xiang River a year ago.

353
00:25:18,590 --> 00:25:19,650
It was dealt with then.

354
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:20,650
But for some reason,

355
00:25:20,870 --> 00:25:22,500
it suddenly appeared in Changsha.

356
00:25:23,150 --> 00:25:24,090
It does seem off.

357
00:25:24,950 --> 00:25:26,260
From appointing an acting Defense Commander

358
00:25:26,670 --> 00:25:27,740
to sealing the city and imposing a curfew,

359
00:25:27,910 --> 00:25:28,890
it took less than a day.

360
00:25:29,560 --> 00:25:30,330
That's way too fast.

361
00:25:31,150 --> 00:25:32,330
How are the other clans of the Mystic Nine?

362
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:33,460
As instructed, we went

363
00:25:33,910 --> 00:25:35,500
to the residences of Second, Third,

364
00:25:35,590 --> 00:25:36,170
and Ninth Masters,

365
00:25:36,480 --> 00:25:37,460
but none of them was home.

366
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:39,930
We were told that Ninth Master

367
00:25:40,760 --> 00:25:42,020
went to the Ministry of War

368
00:25:42,190 --> 00:25:43,570
to help investigate some bandit trouble,

369
00:25:44,430 --> 00:25:45,650
and that Third Master went there

370
00:25:45,840 --> 00:25:47,130
to assist with the Otherworld Tower investigation.

371
00:25:48,040 --> 00:25:48,610
As for Second Master,

372
00:25:49,840 --> 00:25:50,780
something's not right.

373
00:25:51,180 --> 00:25:53,340
[Pear Garden, Closed]

374
00:25:53,350 --> 00:25:55,410
It's said a senior official invited him to perform,

375
00:25:55,840 --> 00:25:56,980
and he won't be back for a few days.

376
00:25:59,000 --> 00:25:59,740
Closed?

377
00:26:01,560 --> 00:26:02,220
Anyone there?

378
00:26:14,190 --> 00:26:14,650
Master Zhang,

379
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,410
they're not eradicating a cult.

380
00:26:16,910 --> 00:26:18,500
They're coming after the Mystic Nine.

381
00:26:18,910 --> 00:26:19,540
Huo Wenhai

382
00:26:19,950 --> 00:26:20,930
must be

383
00:26:20,950 --> 00:26:21,570
behind this.

384
00:26:23,350 --> 00:26:24,020
Huo Wenhai?

385
00:26:25,150 --> 00:26:26,300
Has something happened to the Huo Clan?

386
00:26:27,150 --> 00:26:28,330
The Huo Clan's women are still there.

387
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:29,890
Maybe he spared them

388
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:30,890
for old times' sake.

389
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:31,700
But the Huo residence

390
00:26:32,040 --> 00:26:32,850
is already under his control.

391
00:26:36,560 --> 00:26:37,610
Huo Wenhai has long wanted

392
00:26:37,630 --> 00:26:38,780
to destroy the Mystic Nine.

393
00:26:39,430 --> 00:26:40,930
Now, with all this going on,

394
00:26:42,760 --> 00:26:43,260
could it be...?

395
00:26:43,800 --> 00:26:44,820
If he's really behind this,

396
00:26:46,320 --> 00:26:47,090
I'm afraid they're

397
00:26:47,110 --> 00:26:47,850
in grave danger.

398
00:26:48,800 --> 00:26:49,410
Back then, to stop

399
00:26:49,430 --> 00:26:50,650
his own mother from remarrying,

400
00:26:50,870 --> 00:26:52,170
he even slashed her face.

401
00:26:53,240 --> 00:26:54,460
If a man like that gets his way,

402
00:26:54,590 --> 00:26:55,700
he won't leave anyone alive.

403
00:26:56,280 --> 00:26:57,170
Who issued the order

404
00:26:57,320 --> 00:26:57,890
to seal the city?

405
00:26:58,320 --> 00:26:59,260
It came from the Special Commission Office

406
00:26:59,590 --> 00:27:00,540
through military command channels.

407
00:27:01,040 --> 00:27:01,820
All the paperwork is in order.

408
00:27:02,870 --> 00:27:04,460
So it really was ordered by the Ministry of War.

409
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:05,500
This is bad.

410
00:27:05,560 --> 00:27:06,060
Master Zhang,

411
00:27:06,520 --> 00:27:07,330
the Mystic Nine

412
00:27:07,430 --> 00:27:08,820
may not survive this.

413
00:27:09,870 --> 00:27:10,700
If the Ministry of War

414
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:12,500
had really ordered a purge of the Mystic Nine,

415
00:27:13,350 --> 00:27:15,020
they could've openly sent troops.

416
00:27:15,670 --> 00:27:16,570
There would've been no need

417
00:27:16,670 --> 00:27:17,500
to suppress the news,

418
00:27:18,110 --> 00:27:19,540
much less fabricate

419
00:27:20,040 --> 00:27:21,060
some absurd excuse

420
00:27:21,590 --> 00:27:22,610
about eradicating a cult.

421
00:27:23,390 --> 00:27:24,700
If the reason is false,

422
00:27:25,430 --> 00:27:26,570
it means this whole affair

423
00:27:26,950 --> 00:27:27,740
can't be made public.

424
00:27:27,910 --> 00:27:28,890
The Ministry of War

425
00:27:29,870 --> 00:27:31,220
must not have enough evidence

426
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,130
to convict the Mystic Nine.

427
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,930
If Huo Wenhai is truly moving

428
00:27:34,950 --> 00:27:35,820
against the Mystic Nine,

429
00:27:37,390 --> 00:27:38,820
he won't dare kill anyone.

430
00:27:40,040 --> 00:27:41,410
He'd be afraid of causing too much trouble.

431
00:27:41,840 --> 00:27:42,740
Then the Ministry of War

432
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:43,740
would deny everything

433
00:27:44,430 --> 00:27:46,540
and dismiss him first.

434
00:27:47,390 --> 00:27:48,370
Good point, Master Zhang.

435
00:27:49,280 --> 00:27:50,330
What Huo Wenhai fears most

436
00:27:50,630 --> 00:27:51,700
is losing his uniform.

437
00:27:52,190 --> 00:27:53,410
Without that status,

438
00:27:53,870 --> 00:27:54,540
in the Huo Clan,

439
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:55,850
he'd be worth less than a dog.

440
00:27:56,350 --> 00:27:57,330
But each of the Mystic Nine's leaders

441
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,370
is a tough opponent.

442
00:27:58,720 --> 00:27:59,850
How could someone like Huo Wenhai

443
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:01,610
possibly take them down?

444
00:28:02,280 --> 00:28:02,740
Exactly.

445
00:28:03,390 --> 00:28:04,740
That's also what baffles me.

446
00:28:05,360 --> 00:28:06,660
He must've used

447
00:28:06,680 --> 00:28:07,540
some underhanded trick.

448
00:28:08,430 --> 00:28:08,980
Otherwise,

449
00:28:09,950 --> 00:28:10,740
even if they deployed

450
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:11,610
an entire battalion,

451
00:28:12,190 --> 00:28:13,610
any clan leader of the Mystic Nine

452
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:14,930
could escape without much trouble.

453
00:28:16,760 --> 00:28:17,330
Master Zhang,

454
00:28:17,950 --> 00:28:18,610
I think

455
00:28:19,110 --> 00:28:21,060
we should stay out of sight for now.

456
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:22,980
It won't be too late

457
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:23,650
if we

458
00:28:24,080 --> 00:28:25,130
get the full picture first

459
00:28:25,590 --> 00:28:26,460
and then decide what to do.

460
00:28:26,720 --> 00:28:27,300
Right?

461
00:28:27,520 --> 00:28:28,220
I can't leave.

462
00:28:29,390 --> 00:28:30,500
This concerns the Mystic Nine.

463
00:28:31,630 --> 00:28:32,780
I'm the head of the Mystic Nine.

464
00:28:33,760 --> 00:28:34,980
I can't just walk away.

465
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:37,060
Besides, Huo Wenhai

466
00:28:37,080 --> 00:28:38,540
must have men watching the roads.

467
00:28:39,560 --> 00:28:40,820
He probably already knows

468
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:42,570
we've returned to Changsha.

469
00:28:43,760 --> 00:28:45,410
If I leave now, it'll look

470
00:28:45,950 --> 00:28:47,020
like I'm fleeing out of guilt.

471
00:28:47,560 --> 00:28:48,780
So I have to go back into the city.

472
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:50,980
I need to settle this

473
00:28:51,870 --> 00:28:53,130
with him in person.

474
00:28:54,390 --> 00:28:54,980
Xiaoyu, Xiaojin.

475
00:28:55,080 --> 00:28:55,460
Yes.

476
00:28:55,950 --> 00:28:57,060
Call back as many guards

477
00:28:57,350 --> 00:28:58,130
as you can.

478
00:28:58,630 --> 00:28:59,700
If the situation changes,

479
00:29:00,520 --> 00:29:01,540
be ready to respond.

480
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:02,500
- Yes. - Yes.

481
00:29:02,840 --> 00:29:03,890
Laogou, Xiangu,

482
00:29:04,390 --> 00:29:04,850
Tiezui,

483
00:29:05,870 --> 00:29:06,980
find somewhere safe

484
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:07,650
and settle in.

485
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:08,650
Don't return to the city yet.

486
00:29:09,040 --> 00:29:09,500
No.

487
00:29:10,040 --> 00:29:10,780
I can assist you.

488
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:13,090
You have something more important to do.

489
00:29:13,800 --> 00:29:15,090
Contact every newspaper

490
00:29:15,190 --> 00:29:16,020
and news agency you can.

491
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:17,610
Spread the word.

492
00:29:18,320 --> 00:29:19,260
Create public pressure

493
00:29:19,870 --> 00:29:20,740
so Huo Wenhai

494
00:29:20,760 --> 00:29:21,980
has no choice but to bring

495
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:23,500
the whole affair into the open.

496
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:24,740
Then

497
00:29:25,190 --> 00:29:26,740
he'll have to play his hand openly.

498
00:29:28,480 --> 00:29:29,300
Rest assured.

499
00:29:29,560 --> 00:29:30,300
I'll take care of this.

500
00:29:31,630 --> 00:29:32,610
Let's split up.

501
00:29:34,080 --> 00:29:35,460
Where is Huo Wenhai now?

502
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:36,500
Master Zhang,

503
00:29:37,320 --> 00:29:37,930
he...

504
00:29:39,870 --> 00:29:40,820
he's at our residence.

505
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:42,740
I'm sorry.

506
00:29:42,840 --> 00:29:43,850
I couldn't stop him.

507
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:45,890
He got a requisition order from above

508
00:29:46,150 --> 00:29:47,220
to turn the Zhang residence

509
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:48,570
into some kind of martial-law command.

510
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:50,410
He's inside right now.

511
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:52,530
Looks like he really thinks

512
00:29:52,550 --> 00:29:53,820
he has every advantage

513
00:29:53,840 --> 00:29:54,620
and can take me down.

514
00:29:56,070 --> 00:29:57,050
I'd like to see

515
00:29:58,120 --> 00:29:59,460
just what he can possibly do.

516
00:30:12,100 --> 00:30:15,380
[Grocery Store]

517
00:30:16,760 --> 00:30:17,170
Come on.

518
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:20,130
Take this.

519
00:30:22,280 --> 00:30:23,020
Will this really work?

520
00:30:23,390 --> 00:30:24,740
Changsha is under martial law.

521
00:30:25,190 --> 00:30:26,570
Ordinary people can't even be out on the streets.

522
00:30:27,630 --> 00:30:28,820
We have to pose as porters

523
00:30:28,840 --> 00:30:30,410
delivering supplies to the barracks.

524
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:31,930
I've looked into it.

525
00:30:32,350 --> 00:30:33,090
Most of our men

526
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:34,260
have gone over there.

527
00:30:36,350 --> 00:30:36,850
Wait.

528
00:30:38,190 --> 00:30:39,020
Isn't that mask

529
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:41,220
a little too conspicuous?

530
00:30:43,620 --> 00:30:46,150
[Doghead Brand]

531
00:30:46,150 --> 00:30:46,740
Stop!

532
00:30:50,280 --> 00:30:50,850
Sir,

533
00:30:51,430 --> 00:30:52,570
we're delivering supplies.

534
00:30:52,910 --> 00:30:53,610
Show me your pass.

535
00:30:59,180 --> 00:31:01,260
[Pass]

536
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:08,540
Sir,

537
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:09,890
he's caught a chill.

538
00:31:15,910 --> 00:31:16,410
Go on.

539
00:31:16,480 --> 00:31:16,820
Come on.

540
00:31:20,320 --> 00:31:20,740
Move.

541
00:31:30,780 --> 00:31:32,580
[Changsha Temporary Martial-Law Command]

542
00:32:34,350 --> 00:32:35,330
Master Zhang,

543
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:37,780
after traveling all this way,

544
00:32:37,840 --> 00:32:38,700
you must be exhausted.

545
00:32:39,670 --> 00:32:40,500
It's time

546
00:32:40,800 --> 00:32:42,020
you got some proper rest.

547
00:32:42,390 --> 00:32:43,780
Who gave you the right to redeploy

548
00:32:43,800 --> 00:32:44,780
my Zhang Clan guards?

549
00:32:45,560 --> 00:32:46,540
And you've turned

550
00:32:47,280 --> 00:32:48,410
my residence into Changsha's

551
00:32:48,430 --> 00:32:49,330
temporary martial-law command.

552
00:32:49,800 --> 00:32:50,540
What are you trying to do?

553
00:32:54,760 --> 00:32:55,650
At a time like this,

554
00:32:55,670 --> 00:32:56,700
you're still lecturing me

555
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:58,060
about military rules?

556
00:33:00,280 --> 00:33:01,820
The higher-ups want the Mystic Nine wiped out.

557
00:33:03,630 --> 00:33:04,610
I'm only following orders,

558
00:33:05,320 --> 00:33:06,570
suppressing bandits

559
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:08,330
and defending the nation.

560
00:33:08,350 --> 00:33:09,650
But you, Zhang Qishan,

561
00:33:10,320 --> 00:33:12,020
have held power in the Mystic Nine for years

562
00:33:12,670 --> 00:33:13,650
and consorted with criminals.

563
00:33:14,430 --> 00:33:16,130
Can you still tell public duty from private interest,

564
00:33:16,190 --> 00:33:17,540
or country from family?

565
00:33:18,670 --> 00:33:19,570
Unless you're eliminated,

566
00:33:21,040 --> 00:33:22,570
the Mystic Nine can never be uprooted.

567
00:33:25,950 --> 00:33:26,780
Are you sure

568
00:33:29,800 --> 00:33:31,330
you can eliminate me today?

569
00:33:31,590 --> 00:33:32,650
Of course I know

570
00:33:32,670 --> 00:33:33,820
what you're capable of.

571
00:33:35,350 --> 00:33:36,540
Otherwise, I wouldn't have

572
00:33:38,390 --> 00:33:40,020
held back all these years.

573
00:33:40,800 --> 00:33:41,930
But some things

574
00:33:45,630 --> 00:33:46,820
take more than good timing.

575
00:33:48,280 --> 00:33:49,020
Zhang Qishan,

576
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:51,740
this day next year

577
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:54,570
will be the anniversary of your death!

578
00:36:04,040 --> 00:36:04,740
Stop!

579
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:33,060
Sir.

580
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:34,460
Huo Wenhai,

581
00:36:36,040 --> 00:36:37,410
you're an officer of the National Revolutionary Army,

582
00:36:38,430 --> 00:36:39,570
not some street thug!

583
00:36:41,630 --> 00:36:42,410
If you still remember

584
00:36:42,430 --> 00:36:43,260
who you are,

585
00:36:45,950 --> 00:36:47,300
put aside your personal grudges

586
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:48,610
with Zhang Qishan and the Mystic Nine.

587
00:36:56,190 --> 00:36:57,220
Just because he interfered

588
00:36:57,240 --> 00:36:58,130
in Xie Jiu's case,

589
00:37:00,870 --> 00:37:02,460
you've held a grudge against him

590
00:37:03,080 --> 00:37:05,540
and come to his own residence looking for trouble?

591
00:37:06,630 --> 00:37:08,330
If I hadn't arrived in time today,

592
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:09,980
he could've charged you

593
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,220
with trying to murder an ally

594
00:37:11,720 --> 00:37:12,570
and violating military discipline.

595
00:37:13,240 --> 00:37:14,610
You'd never be able to clear your name!

596
00:37:16,520 --> 00:37:17,170
You're

597
00:37:18,840 --> 00:37:19,740
still too young

598
00:37:20,350 --> 00:37:21,410
and far too arrogant.

599
00:37:22,430 --> 00:37:23,650
Go back and write me a proper self-criticism!

600
00:37:25,430 --> 00:37:25,850
Sir...

601
00:37:25,950 --> 00:37:26,330
What?

602
00:37:27,080 --> 00:37:27,850
Have I wronged you?

603
00:37:30,190 --> 00:37:30,980
If you have something to say,

604
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:32,610
say it now.

605
00:37:33,590 --> 00:37:33,980
No, sir.

606
00:37:38,840 --> 00:37:39,410
One more thing.

607
00:37:43,720 --> 00:37:45,780
This is the residence of the Changsha Defense Commander.

608
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:47,650
Give it back to Qishan.

609
00:37:48,910 --> 00:37:51,060
Get everyone and everything

610
00:37:51,870 --> 00:37:53,410
back to wherever they came from!

611
00:37:53,950 --> 00:37:54,460
Now!

612
00:37:55,390 --> 00:37:55,850
Yes, sir!

613
00:37:56,560 --> 00:37:57,020
Move out!

614
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:16,790
Master Zhang?

615
00:38:17,600 --> 00:38:18,260
Qishan,

616
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:21,420
these two adjutants of yours

617
00:38:21,720 --> 00:38:22,690
are quite a handful.

618
00:38:23,870 --> 00:38:25,300
They were running around the barracks

619
00:38:25,320 --> 00:38:26,180
in civilian clothes.

620
00:38:26,760 --> 00:38:28,010
They violated martial law regulations

621
00:38:33,120 --> 00:38:34,410
and even forged transfer orders.

622
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:37,780
I've brought them along.

623
00:38:39,470 --> 00:38:41,410
You'd better discipline them properly.

624
00:38:45,030 --> 00:38:45,820
Thank you, sir.

625
00:38:46,550 --> 00:38:47,530
They'll be properly disciplined.

626
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,220
I came today to discuss

627
00:38:50,800 --> 00:38:52,010
something very important

628
00:38:52,030 --> 00:38:52,780
with you.

629
00:38:53,800 --> 00:38:54,410
If there's

630
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:56,620
anything you want to do,

631
00:38:56,990 --> 00:38:57,930
do it now.

632
00:38:58,600 --> 00:39:00,010
Because I'm afraid

633
00:39:00,870 --> 00:39:01,490
that after we talk,

634
00:39:02,350 --> 00:39:03,490
you may not get the chance.

635
00:39:14,320 --> 00:39:14,820
Master Zhang.

636
00:39:23,470 --> 00:39:24,490
If I hadn't arrived,

637
00:39:25,160 --> 00:39:26,370
you'd probably be dead now.

638
00:39:27,950 --> 00:39:29,100
You don't have what it takes,

639
00:39:29,390 --> 00:39:30,740
yet you went after Zhang Qishan.

640
00:39:31,910 --> 00:39:32,970
I only wanted to do away

641
00:39:32,990 --> 00:39:34,530
with the Mystic Nine as soon as possible.

642
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:37,220
Zhang Qishan is too deeply tied to them.

643
00:39:37,680 --> 00:39:38,330
As long as he's around,

644
00:39:38,680 --> 00:39:40,140
it'll be difficult to make moves.

645
00:39:41,680 --> 00:39:43,780
I never really intended to harm him.

646
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:44,530
I only wanted

647
00:39:45,160 --> 00:39:46,660
to keep him from interfering for a while.

648
00:39:50,870 --> 00:39:52,010
Didn't you say the leaders

649
00:39:52,600 --> 00:39:53,850
of the Mystic Nine couldn't be killed?

650
00:39:53,870 --> 00:39:55,220
That's why I've held Eryue Hong,

651
00:39:55,240 --> 00:39:55,850
Banjie Li,

652
00:39:55,870 --> 00:39:57,050
Heibei Laoliu, and Xie Jiu

653
00:39:57,070 --> 00:39:57,890
in custody for now.

654
00:39:59,280 --> 00:40:00,410
I did exactly as you instructed

655
00:40:00,430 --> 00:40:01,660
and never overstepped in the slightest.

656
00:40:02,120 --> 00:40:03,050
As I instructed?

657
00:40:05,120 --> 00:40:06,740
You deliberately twisted the orders from above

658
00:40:07,390 --> 00:40:08,660
to serve your own ends.

659
00:40:09,640 --> 00:40:10,300
Huo Wenhai,

660
00:40:10,550 --> 00:40:11,890
that's a grave taboo in the Ministry of War.

661
00:40:12,390 --> 00:40:13,220
Do you think

662
00:40:13,240 --> 00:40:14,490
the officials there are fools

663
00:40:15,160 --> 00:40:16,410
who can't see through your little schemes?

664
00:40:17,280 --> 00:40:18,330
I would never dare.

665
00:40:18,390 --> 00:40:19,930
I only wanted to ease your burden.

666
00:40:19,950 --> 00:40:20,410
I just...

667
00:40:22,160 --> 00:40:23,260
I failed to think things through

668
00:40:23,470 --> 00:40:24,330
and acted rashly.

669
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:26,260
Please forgive me, sir.

670
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:30,620
You want to ease my burden

671
00:40:31,600 --> 00:40:33,300
and resolve the Ministry of War's concerns?

672
00:40:34,470 --> 00:40:35,490
Then why

673
00:40:35,760 --> 00:40:36,890
is the Huo Clan exempt?

674
00:40:38,160 --> 00:40:39,490
What will the higher-ups think?

675
00:40:43,640 --> 00:40:45,740
I'm loyal only to the Ministry of War.

676
00:40:47,240 --> 00:40:48,050
With the Mystic Nine around,

677
00:40:48,160 --> 00:40:49,300
Changsha will never know peace.

678
00:40:50,430 --> 00:40:51,740
Since the Huo Clan is part of the Mystic Nine,

679
00:40:52,030 --> 00:40:52,820
it should be purged as well.

680
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:55,660
I'll handle it myself

681
00:40:57,120 --> 00:40:58,050
and show no favoritism.

682
00:41:01,510 --> 00:41:02,530
I'm partly to blame.

683
00:41:02,950 --> 00:41:04,740
When I gave you the order,

684
00:41:04,950 --> 00:41:05,970
I wasn't clear enough.

685
00:41:06,840 --> 00:41:08,140
But military orders are absolute.

686
00:41:08,950 --> 00:41:10,820
Now that the purge of the Mystic Nine

687
00:41:11,390 --> 00:41:12,300
has begun,

688
00:41:13,840 --> 00:41:15,620
we can't reverse course overnight.

689
00:41:15,910 --> 00:41:17,450
Besides, the higher-ups already know.

690
00:41:18,950 --> 00:41:20,450
If you're going to do it, do it cleanly.

691
00:41:21,240 --> 00:41:22,410
Don't leave any loose ends.

692
00:41:22,990 --> 00:41:23,700
Otherwise,

693
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:24,930
there will be severe consequences.

694
00:41:29,020 --> 00:41:30,620
[Xinyue Restaurant]

695
00:41:35,420 --> 00:41:40,060
[Lumen Grand Theatre]

696
00:41:41,820 --> 00:41:43,120
[Sealed by the Military Affairs Commission]

697
00:41:43,120 --> 00:41:43,700
Sir,

698
00:41:44,160 --> 00:41:45,410
all the shops along the street

699
00:41:45,510 --> 00:41:46,370
have been sealed off,

700
00:41:46,800 --> 00:41:48,050
including Xinyue Restaurant.

701
00:41:49,120 --> 00:41:49,620
Father,

702
00:41:50,120 --> 00:41:50,850
haven't the authorities

703
00:41:50,870 --> 00:41:51,970
always treated us well?

704
00:41:52,280 --> 00:41:53,530
Why have they turned against us?

705
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:55,100
Don't we have an agreement

706
00:41:55,120 --> 00:41:56,140
with those at the very top?

707
00:41:57,070 --> 00:41:58,820
A storm is brewing.

708
00:42:00,120 --> 00:42:01,660
It seems

709
00:42:01,680 --> 00:42:02,890
a major war is coming.

710
00:42:03,870 --> 00:42:05,180
We need to be prepared as well.

711
00:42:05,550 --> 00:42:06,410
Tell everyone

712
00:42:06,680 --> 00:42:08,140
that all auctions are indefinitely suspended.

713
00:42:08,280 --> 00:42:09,620
Move everything into Warehouse 11.

714
00:42:11,910 --> 00:42:12,700
Go to the telegraph office.

715
00:42:13,240 --> 00:42:14,330
I'm sending Zhang Qishan a telegram.

716
00:42:14,390 --> 00:42:14,970
Yes, sir.

717
00:42:31,070 --> 00:42:31,490
Master Zhang,

718
00:42:32,070 --> 00:42:32,820
a telegram from Mr. Yin.

719
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:33,970
Read it.

720
00:42:34,470 --> 00:42:35,300
This is urgent.

721
00:42:35,680 --> 00:42:36,580
You'd better read it yourself.

722
00:42:42,870 --> 00:42:45,220
Xinyue Restaurant and all Yin family properties

723
00:42:45,470 --> 00:42:46,930
have been seized by the Ministry of War.

724
00:42:47,600 --> 00:42:49,260
The telephone at the residence is also being monitored.

725
00:42:50,760 --> 00:42:52,010
I've learned what happened in Beiping.

726
00:42:53,030 --> 00:42:55,010
Are you and Xinyue safe?

727
00:42:56,990 --> 00:42:57,850
Changsha has fallen into chaos.

728
00:42:58,840 --> 00:42:59,740
Many of the Mystic Nine

729
00:43:00,160 --> 00:43:01,490
are in Huo Wenhai's hands.

730
00:43:02,600 --> 00:43:03,450
The situation is urgent.

731
00:43:04,430 --> 00:43:05,410
I can't get away.

732
00:43:09,700 --> 00:43:12,260
[Taiho Telegraph Office]

733
00:43:28,640 --> 00:43:29,100
Father,

734
00:43:29,720 --> 00:43:30,530
how is he?

735
00:43:37,120 --> 00:43:38,300
Safe for now, it seems.

736
00:43:46,120 --> 00:43:46,620
Father,

737
00:43:47,550 --> 00:43:49,100
what do you make

738
00:43:49,430 --> 00:43:50,450
of the situation in Changsha?

739
00:43:51,680 --> 00:43:52,580
The Mystic Nine

740
00:43:53,430 --> 00:43:55,180
are a force born among the people to resist

741
00:43:55,200 --> 00:43:56,330
warlords and aristocratic powers.

742
00:43:57,680 --> 00:43:58,660
They emerged naturally

743
00:43:58,680 --> 00:43:59,820
from troubled times.

744
00:44:00,680 --> 00:44:02,370
But now, our country

745
00:44:02,800 --> 00:44:05,100
is about to be tested by war.

746
00:44:05,990 --> 00:44:07,180
Before long,

747
00:44:07,950 --> 00:44:09,780
you'll see a new world.

748
00:44:10,720 --> 00:44:12,490
When that world comes,

749
00:44:13,240 --> 00:44:13,970
perhaps people

750
00:44:15,200 --> 00:44:16,820
will no longer need the Mystic Nine.

751
00:44:20,030 --> 00:44:20,740
I understand.

752
00:44:21,910 --> 00:44:23,330
The Mystic Nine may be

753
00:44:23,990 --> 00:44:25,740
a ship built on honor and justice,

754
00:44:27,550 --> 00:44:28,450
but it can

755
00:44:28,470 --> 00:44:29,490
no longer sail on.

756
00:44:30,160 --> 00:44:30,780
Exactly.

757
00:44:32,160 --> 00:44:33,100
The problem

758
00:44:33,120 --> 00:44:34,490
the Mystic Nine face isn't Huo Wenhai.

759
00:44:34,640 --> 00:44:35,930
Nor is it the Ministry of War.

760
00:44:37,070 --> 00:44:38,660
It has fulfilled its purpose.

761
00:44:39,070 --> 00:44:39,890
In the future,

762
00:44:40,550 --> 00:44:42,010
people will no longer accept it.

763
00:44:43,200 --> 00:44:44,330
So whether Zhang Qishan

764
00:44:44,910 --> 00:44:45,850
stays

765
00:44:45,870 --> 00:44:47,010
aboard that old ship

766
00:44:48,030 --> 00:44:49,700
or steps into the new world

767
00:44:51,160 --> 00:44:52,660
is entirely up to him.

768
00:44:57,240 --> 00:44:57,820
I know.

769
00:45:01,550 --> 00:45:02,530
As husband and wife, we stand as one.

770
00:45:03,430 --> 00:45:05,330
I know he's not a man bound by the old ways.

771
00:45:09,160 --> 00:45:10,850
I can't make the choice for him.

772
00:45:12,950 --> 00:45:14,330
Nor will I interfere.

773
00:45:23,720 --> 00:45:26,620
As the last of the Mystic Nine,

774
00:45:26,720 --> 00:45:29,140
the Xie Clan must maintain its order,

775
00:45:29,510 --> 00:45:30,700
keep the other clans in check,

776
00:45:30,840 --> 00:45:31,930
support whichever clan holds power,

777
00:45:32,070 --> 00:45:33,850
and keep the Mystic Nine on the right path

778
00:45:33,950 --> 00:45:34,970
without disturbing the people

779
00:45:35,280 --> 00:45:36,370
or the authorities,

780
00:45:36,600 --> 00:45:38,450
[Young Xie Jiu]
so peace may endure for generations.

781
00:45:38,600 --> 00:45:40,620
That is the duty of the Xie Clan.

782
00:45:40,720 --> 00:45:43,010
Then what are the Mystic Nine?

783
00:45:43,010 --> 00:45:44,030
[Elder of the Xie Clan]

784
00:45:44,030 --> 00:45:46,580
Why do they need to exist?

785
00:45:46,760 --> 00:45:49,010
When the authorities are unjust and the law falls short,

786
00:45:49,120 --> 00:45:50,740
martial brotherhoods throughout history

787
00:45:50,760 --> 00:45:52,110
have stepped in to right wrongs in trade,

788
00:45:52,240 --> 00:45:54,140
banding together to gather the people's strength

789
00:45:54,280 --> 00:45:55,450
and balance the strong against the weak.

790
00:45:57,320 --> 00:45:58,530
Then what

791
00:45:59,470 --> 00:46:00,780
will your name be?

792
00:46:01,240 --> 00:46:03,530
If I become the head of the clan,

793
00:46:03,680 --> 00:46:04,700
I'll take the name Jiu,
[*Jiu: nine]

794
00:46:04,760 --> 00:46:06,580
to guard the Mystic Nine and carry on its legacy.

795
00:46:07,680 --> 00:46:08,330
Good.

796
00:46:08,950 --> 00:46:09,660
Very good.

797
00:46:09,840 --> 00:46:10,970
The strength of the Mystic Nine

798
00:46:11,200 --> 00:46:12,930
lies with its top leader,

799
00:46:13,350 --> 00:46:14,580
who must be righteous and strong

800
00:46:14,640 --> 00:46:16,220
and never stray from the right path.

801
00:46:17,160 --> 00:46:19,850
The Xie Clan will shoulder the difficult deeds,

802
00:46:20,640 --> 00:46:21,820
bear the consequences ourselves,

803
00:46:22,120 --> 00:46:23,300
and act for the good of the people.

804
00:46:23,950 --> 00:46:25,780
That is the honor of the last of the Nine.

805
00:46:26,640 --> 00:46:28,410
What is the greatest duty of the Xie Clan?

806
00:46:29,160 --> 00:46:30,490
The Xie Clan must quietly maintain

807
00:46:30,510 --> 00:46:31,580
the order of the Mystic Nine.

808
00:46:31,840 --> 00:46:33,330
Whichever clan comes to power,

809
00:46:33,430 --> 00:46:35,410
whether it comes from high standing

810
00:46:35,430 --> 00:46:36,740
or humble origins,

811
00:46:36,870 --> 00:46:38,780
we must do all we can to support it

812
00:46:38,990 --> 00:46:40,530
and guide it onto the right path.

813
00:46:40,680 --> 00:46:42,850
Only then can the Mystic Nine endure for generations.

814
00:46:43,870 --> 00:46:45,260
And what matters most when assisting

815
00:46:45,870 --> 00:46:47,100
the other clans of the Mystic Nine?

816
00:46:47,510 --> 00:46:49,010
The foundation of the Mystic Nine

817
00:46:49,160 --> 00:46:50,300
lies with its top leader.

818
00:46:50,510 --> 00:46:51,890
He must be righteous and strong

819
00:46:52,120 --> 00:46:53,140
and never take the wrong path.

820
00:46:53,350 --> 00:46:54,450
As for the difficult things

821
00:46:54,510 --> 00:46:55,820
that still must be done,

822
00:46:55,870 --> 00:46:57,620
the Xie Clan will take them on.

823
00:46:58,070 --> 00:46:59,370
I will bear the consequences myself.

824
00:46:59,470 --> 00:47:00,850
As long as I can protect the Mystic Nine

825
00:47:00,950 --> 00:47:01,780
and serve the people,

826
00:47:02,070 --> 00:47:02,850
it will be worth it.

827
00:47:39,990 --> 00:47:41,530
Huo Wenhai acted on his own

828
00:47:42,120 --> 00:47:43,970
and arrested several clan leaders of the Mystic Nine.

829
00:47:48,600 --> 00:47:50,050
The higher-ups intend to turn a blind eye for now

830
00:47:50,840 --> 00:47:53,450
and let Huo Wenhai make an example of the Mystic Nine

831
00:47:53,870 --> 00:47:55,050
to warn the others.

832
00:47:56,070 --> 00:47:57,100
At noon tomorrow,

833
00:47:57,510 --> 00:47:58,660
you'll all be executed.

834
00:48:03,640 --> 00:48:04,530
The Ministry of War

835
00:48:04,720 --> 00:48:06,260
has raised itself quite a mad dog.

836
00:48:07,680 --> 00:48:08,970
To climb the ranks,

837
00:48:09,470 --> 00:48:10,890
there's nothing he won't do.

838
00:48:13,120 --> 00:48:13,780
Mr. Luo,

839
00:48:14,350 --> 00:48:15,930
the fate of the Mystic Nine is already sealed.

840
00:48:17,160 --> 00:48:18,140
What you care about more

841
00:48:19,550 --> 00:48:21,820
is whether Changsha can remain stable, isn't it?

842
00:48:22,910 --> 00:48:24,100
The moment we die,

843
00:48:25,600 --> 00:48:27,820
Changsha will descend into chaos.

844
00:48:32,200 --> 00:48:33,700
With the war intensifying,

845
00:48:34,470 --> 00:48:35,620
the situation is a mess.

846
00:48:36,910 --> 00:48:38,620
Zhang Qishan has troops under his command

847
00:48:38,720 --> 00:48:39,530
and knows how to fight.

848
00:48:39,840 --> 00:48:41,530
He's highly valued by the Ministry of War.

849
00:48:41,910 --> 00:48:43,140
They're keeping him for the front lines.

850
00:48:43,550 --> 00:48:44,620
As for the other clan leaders,

851
00:48:46,200 --> 00:48:47,450
if they're dealt with quickly,

852
00:48:48,240 --> 00:48:49,890
Changsha won't fall into chaos.

853
00:48:51,950 --> 00:48:54,010
You sounded so sincere before,

854
00:48:54,950 --> 00:48:55,890
but in the end,

855
00:48:55,910 --> 00:48:57,700
all you want is to keep Zhang Qishan.

856
00:48:59,240 --> 00:49:01,140
The Mystic Nine has stood for a century,

857
00:49:02,430 --> 00:49:03,580
but to you,

858
00:49:05,510 --> 00:49:08,700
it's just something to be cut away in one clean stroke.

859
00:49:08,760 --> 00:49:09,700
Circumstances leave us no choice.

860
00:49:10,200 --> 00:49:11,300
There's no room for sentiment.

861
00:49:12,600 --> 00:49:13,220
Mr. Xie,

862
00:49:14,280 --> 00:49:15,220
you understand better than I do

863
00:49:15,240 --> 00:49:16,450
what it means to consider the greater good.

864
00:49:16,950 --> 00:49:17,820
Besides, I gave you

865
00:49:17,870 --> 00:49:18,820
time and opportunity.

866
00:49:19,350 --> 00:49:20,740
And you promised me a solution too,

867
00:49:21,470 --> 00:49:22,010
didn't you?

868
00:49:25,550 --> 00:49:27,180
There is a way.

869
00:49:30,240 --> 00:49:32,100
Kill six and spare three.

870
00:49:33,950 --> 00:49:34,970
Among the Mystic Nine,

871
00:49:36,430 --> 00:49:37,300
the Zhang Clan,

872
00:49:38,160 --> 00:49:39,100
the Hong Clan,

873
00:49:39,910 --> 00:49:41,660
and the Huo Clan must be spared,

874
00:49:43,160 --> 00:49:44,850
or Changsha will fall into chaos.

875
00:49:45,760 --> 00:49:47,370
As for the other six,

876
00:49:49,720 --> 00:49:50,850
let Zhang Qishan

877
00:49:50,870 --> 00:49:52,180
eliminate them himself.

878
00:49:53,390 --> 00:49:55,220
Once the Mystic Nine lose their foundation,

879
00:49:55,510 --> 00:49:56,580
they'll never rise again.

880
00:49:56,990 --> 00:49:57,620
That way,

881
00:49:59,390 --> 00:50:00,930
your position will remain secure,

882
00:50:02,320 --> 00:50:04,300
the Mystic Nine will survive in name only,

883
00:50:06,720 --> 00:50:08,780
and Changsha will remain stable.

884
00:50:10,990 --> 00:50:12,010
Zhang Qishan

885
00:50:12,030 --> 00:50:12,970
values loyalty deeply.

886
00:50:15,470 --> 00:50:16,330
Are you sure he can

887
00:50:16,350 --> 00:50:17,300
bring himself to do it?

888
00:50:19,800 --> 00:50:20,970
If he can't,

889
00:50:22,760 --> 00:50:24,930
I'll force him to.

890
00:50:44,240 --> 00:50:46,530
When this candle goes out tonight,

891
00:50:49,760 --> 00:50:52,260
the Mystic Nine will enter a long night,

892
00:50:56,550 --> 00:50:57,890
Master Zhang.

893
00:51:18,740 --> 00:51:22,900
♪The past fades like smoke♪

894
00:51:23,260 --> 00:51:25,980
♪A choice is made in silence♪

895
00:51:26,260 --> 00:51:29,060
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

896
00:51:29,460 --> 00:51:33,220
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

897
00:51:33,460 --> 00:51:36,900
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

898
00:51:37,180 --> 00:51:40,580
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

899
00:51:40,660 --> 00:51:47,940
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

900
00:51:48,380 --> 00:51:51,660
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

901
00:51:51,940 --> 00:51:55,180
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

902
00:51:55,340 --> 00:51:59,380
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

903
00:51:59,580 --> 00:52:02,940
♪Who believes in fate?♪

904
00:52:03,180 --> 00:52:06,540
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

905
00:52:06,780 --> 00:52:10,060
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

906
00:52:10,380 --> 00:52:14,060
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

907
00:52:14,260 --> 00:52:17,500
♪Take care♪

908
00:52:17,500 --> 00:52:20,060
♪We once raced♪

909
00:52:20,140 --> 00:52:22,060
♪For the dawn♪

910
00:52:22,220 --> 00:52:25,500
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

911
00:52:25,620 --> 00:52:28,900
♪In the web of fate♪

912
00:52:28,900 --> 00:52:32,100
♪No one can escape♪

913
00:52:33,100 --> 00:52:34,940
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

914
00:52:35,100 --> 00:52:36,660
♪We too were young once♪

915
00:52:36,740 --> 00:52:40,180
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

916
00:52:40,380 --> 00:52:42,700
♪Keep the ember lit♪

917
00:52:42,820 --> 00:52:47,340
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

918
00:52:47,460 --> 00:52:50,420
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

919
00:52:50,660 --> 00:52:54,180
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

920
00:52:54,300 --> 00:52:58,060
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

921
00:52:58,380 --> 00:53:01,860
♪Who believes in fate?♪

922
00:53:02,020 --> 00:53:05,020
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

923
00:53:05,260 --> 00:53:09,020
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

924
00:53:09,180 --> 00:53:12,900
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

925
00:53:13,020 --> 00:53:24,460
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
